---
import Base from './Base.astro';
import config from '../../site.config.json';
const { frontmatter } = Astro.props;
---
<Base title={`${frontmatter.title} | LLM Systems Engineering`} description={frontmatter.description}><article class="article"><header class="article-header"><a href="/#learn">← 학습 경로</a><p class="eyebrow">{frontmatter.track} · {frontmatter.date}</p><h1>{frontmatter.title}</h1><p class="lede">{frontmatter.description}</p></header><div class="prose"><slot/></div><aside class="article-end"><p>궁금한 점이나 정정할 내용이 있나요?</p><a href={`${config.repository}/issues`}>GitHub에서 의견 남기기 ↗</a><a href="/#articles">글 목록으로 돌아가기 →</a></aside></article></Base>
